d equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-5 & =3x-3 \\\\ 2x-5-2x & =3x-3-2x \\\\ -5 & =x-3 \\\\ -5+3 & =x-3+3 \\\\ x & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $2x-5=3x-3$ has the unique solution $x=-2.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-4 & =5x-4 \\\\ 5x-4-5x & =5x-4-5x \\\\ -4 & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $x.$ Therefore, the equation $5x-4=5x-4$ has infinitely many solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252123 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252124 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252125 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252126 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252127 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1041 "selection" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1104 #edb/ref 17592186252125 13194139533800 true] [17592186252122 1110 #uuid "76c46080-f181-5de9-aa39-b8ee838c7452" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252123 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252123 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533800 true] [17592186252123 1111 #uuid "269a5f6f-e47b-5c97-80e5-197b32aa5f3c" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252124 1034 "I only" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252124 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533800 true] [17592186252124 1111 #uuid "c2f1183d-d642-5afb-a2bc-8afbed9821c9" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252125 1034 "III only" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252125 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533800 true] [17592186252125 1111 #uuid "c6d43ed6-0aef-5730-8742-3a4e494d4158" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252126 1034 "I and II only" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252126 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533800 true] [17592186252126 1111 #uuid "750c2253-4e2c-5ed0-a2ce-8cc8141a1176" 13194139533800 true] [17592186252127 1034 "II only